description: "quality[6]: Single Responsibility,Single Meaning,Explicit Definition,Explicit Relationships,Engineering Value,Reusable validation[6]: Every atom has one identity.,Every atom has one definition.,Every atom belongs to one domain.,Every atom has explicit relationships.,Every atom is reusable.,Every atom is independently understandable. graph[6]: No isolated atoms.,Every atom participates,in at least one relationship.,Every atom contributes,to one or more Engineering,Knowledge Records. evolution[7]: Knowledge Atoms may,gain relationships,improve definitions,gain examples,improve validation,Knowledge Atoms may never,lose identity engineering[6]: Reusable,Explainable,Searchable,Linkable,Composable,Machine Interpretable success[4]: Every engineering concept,can be represented,using one or more,Knowledge Atoms. guarantees[5]: Universal Engineering Vocabulary,Minimal Semantic Units,Graph Native Knowledge,Unlimited Composition,Cross Domain Reusability"
